{"id":1398,"imdb":"tt0079944","en":"Stalker","orig":"Сталкер","ar":"مطارد","tag":"There's no need to speak. You must only...concentrate and recall all your past life. When a man thinks of the past, he becomes kinder.","ov":"بالقرب من مدينة رمادية اللون وغير مسماة تقع المنطقة، وهي مكان تحرسه الأسلاك الشائكة والجنود، وحيث تقع قوانين الفيزياء العادية ضحية للشذوذ المتكرر. يقوم أحد المطاردين بإرشاد رجلين إلى المنطقة، وتحديدًا إلى منطقة تتحقق فيها الرغبات الدفينة.","rd":"1979-05-25","rt":162,"g":[878,18],"lang":"ru","budget":120000,"revenue":36784519,"companies":[{"n":"Mosfilm","logo":"/xenuUvcunUNpbaDOYGhWZERaym7.png","c":"SU"}],"countries":["SU"],"langs":["Russian"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"SU","d":"1979-05-25"},{"c":"NL","d":"1980-04-17"},{"c":"FI","d":"1980-08-15"},{"c":"BE","d":"1980-11-13"},{"c":"GB","d":"1980-12-02"},{"c":"IT","d":"1980-12-24"},{"c":"BR","d":"1980-12-26"},{"c":"SE","d":"1981-04-13"},{"c":"IE","d":"1981-04-17"},{"c":"DE","d":"1981-05-01"},{"c":"DK","d":"1981-08-24"},{"c":"AR","d":"1981-11-12"},{"c":"FR","d":"1981-11-18"},{"c":"UY","d":"1984-08-08"},{"c":"ES","d":"1984-11-05"},{"c":"TR","d":"1991-09-27"},{"c":"CZ","d":"1999-04-15"},{"c":"CA","d":"2002-10-15"},{"c":"SK","d":"2006-03-11"},{"c":"RU","d":"2011-01-11"},{"c":"US","d":"2014-01-17"},{"c":"MX","d":"2018-08-03"}],"dir":["Andrei Tarkovsky"],"prod":["Aleksandra Demidova"],"wri":["Arkadiy Strugatskiy","Andrei Tarkovsky","Boris Strugatskiy"],"mus":["Eduard Artemyev"],"dop":["Aleksandr Knyazhinsky","Leonid Kalashnikov"],"cast":[{"n":"Alisa Freyndlikh","ch":"Stalker's Wife","p":"/6r90VxIyPWE63DnBS91xeomZmIP.jpg"},{"n":"Aleksandr Kaydanovskiy","ch":"Stalker","p":"/yHYfkxQu3GVKxx5ibFmEom8qAS6.jpg"},{"n":"Anatoliy Solonitsyn","ch":"Writer","p":"/37Vb7vNMHAz1s2WI5kW4BHt0X0N.jpg"},{"n":"Mykola Hrynko","ch":"Professor","p":"/n8lxXQbLYOed7AeowxA49yB2jyS.jpg"},{"n":"Natalya Abramova","ch":"Marta","p":"/iJOfkfk0MT3rW1iVrzp8t4pKotr.jpg"},{"n":"Faime Jurno","ch":"Writer's Companion","p":"/kx04DJQeV2v3fdU23MeudK